All four backbones completed 100/100 dialogues in every condition (1,600/1,600 sessions), confirming that the framework operates reliably regardless of architecture.

\subsection{GPT-4o mini: Per-Condition Breakdown}

The full 4-condition results for GPT-4o mini appear in Table~\ref{tab:evaluation_results} (Section 5.1) and the paired tests in Table~\ref{tab:significance}. Dissonance-Aware leads on all seven metrics; the average uplift over Baseline is $+0.14$ per metric ($+0.97$ on the 7-metric total, $t = 3.53$), concentrated on Guided Discovery, Focus, and Strategy. Notably, GPT-4o mini under Dissonance-Aware reaches Understanding 4.98 against Claude's unaided Baseline of 5.13, a gap of only 0.15 points, at a small fraction of the inference cost.

